  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An assistance award to provide emergency assistance to cyclone-affected populations in vanuatu to ensure children and their families affected by cyclones judy and kevin recover from the impacts of the cyclones and are resilient to future disasters. Humanitarian assistance will be provided to ensure adequate household food security, access to shelter materials, water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) assistance and protection services.</narrative>
  </description>
